//! drain calls [`dispatch_registered`] for every message it reads.{% if project.event_idempotency %} Idempotency keying is generated:
//! every delivery is keyed on (pgmq msg_id, consumer) and handlers run on
//! first delivery only; they may still be non-transactional — a crash
//! after the dedupe insert but before side effects commits loses that
//! run's effects (the at-least-once floor).
